WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
Web DSH is the authenticated platform. SDK, Claude Code, Deep Agents, and Kilo are agent runtimes.

00:09.000 --> 00:19.000
The running broker exposes the first three. Reviewed successor source adds Kilo and one bounded handoff.

00:19.000 --> 00:29.000
Each handoff stage gets a correlation ID, one model start, persisted state, and guarded cancellation.

00:29.000 --> 00:40.000
TrueForge is a separate private interface inside DSH, not another DSH platform.

00:40.000 --> 00:50.000
Private workspace is the normal backend. OpenShell is optional stronger isolation.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
OpenShell stays disabled until all gates pass. Live handoff, Fola audio, and spoken review remain.
